	(text_box "Promemoria catena sicurezze:\n\nS1 (24V)\n- X23 Extracorsa superiore\nS2\n- X17+X19 Allentamenti\nTTF X20/S3	=> UDEC.CX X6/S3\n	UDEC.CX X4/S3 => UDEC.C P0/S3-FOS\n		- P60 Paracadute\n		S3.1-PAR\n		- P61 E-stop cabina\n		S3.2-PEC\n		- P62 Accostamento\n		S3.3-PET\n		- P63 Sblocco porta\n		S3.4-COL\n		- P64 xxx\n		S3.5-TC\n		- P65+P66 xxx\n		S3.6-FT\n	UDEC.CX X4/S3A <= UDEC.C P0/S4-CAB\n	- X15 Inverter (ponte)\n	S3B\n	- X2 Trap (tetto) + bypass\n	S3C\n	- X3 Tray (fondo) + bypass\n	TTF X20/S4 <= UDEC.CX X6/S4\nS4\n- X15 E-stop quadro\nS5\nS8"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
